<p>Thinking about it, perhaps if I go through the train of logic behind this SCP, why I think it is scary, it might awsage a few fears.</p>
<p>I was in bed, it was 3:30 am. I was awake. This was not my fault, I was desperate for sleep, but my flat makes where being loud. Again. For the 3rd night in a row. I thought to myself, man, what if this never ended? What if they NEVER shut up?</p>
