<p>That I'm glad you removed the &quot;memetic&quot; from the article. Unawares of its previous versions, I read it today and thought &quot;Good lord, a decent mental effect SCP and it's not memetic memetic memetic memetic! Praise be to various shiny people sitting up on a cloud!&quot;</p>
<p>It is a little superpowers-y, even if it's superpowers-with-extreme-downsides, but I still think it's okay. About the only thing I'd suggest is altering the bit about the Death Scream vectoring the infection. Just a little. That seems to be the only lingering bit of &quot;meme what makes you crazy and die&quot;, and even that's completely salvageable&#8230; add in some stuff about it knocking people who sense it out cold and when they wake up they've immediately progressed to the &quot;surface thoughts&quot; level, and make it so that people can possibly be infected just by long contact of getting sent thoughts, and suddenly it's not some meme-thing anymore&#8230; it's your brain turning on its telepathic activity ability because it's <em>being used</em>.</p>

